              "text": "Ventus pluviālis ā marī venit. The rainy wind comes from the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An adjective of two endings, from pluvia 'rain'. Aqua pluviālis, rainwater. English pluvial comes from it."
